sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Approve one password fill
    accDescr: The official worker checks the browser target, requests one password through NativeHost, and the desktop checks policy and obtains approval. Denial or stale state returns no secret. A successful response contains the selected username and password; the worker rechecks the target before filling without submission.
    box rgb(248,250,252) Browser Extension
        participant worker as Extension worker
    end
    box rgb(248,250,252) Native Host
        participant host as NativeHost
    end
    box rgb(248,250,252) Desktop App
        participant app as Desktop + Core
    end
    worker->>worker: Prepare target and eligible fields
    worker->>host: getCredentialSecret(origin, ID)
    host->>app: Named pipe: forward request
    app->>app: Check policy before asking approval
    app->>app: If eligible, request Allow once
    app->>app: If approved, recheck state and origin
    alt Denied, expired or changed
        app-->>host: Deny: no secret
        host-->>worker: Deny: no secret
    else Allow and still valid
        app-->>host: Secret: username + password
        host-->>worker: Secret: username + password
        alt Same document and eligible fields
            worker->>worker: Recheck target and fill once (no submit)
        else Target or fields changed
            worker->>worker: Discard result without filling
        end
    end
